# The stock OpenAI client, used by the Phase 2 gate to prove the gateway is genuinely
# compatible — not merely compatible with our own idea of the protocol. It caught a real
# bug curl could not: the SDK closes a stream as soon as it reads [DONE], which raised
# GeneratorExit in the usage recorder and lost every streamed request's token count.
openai==2.53.0
